  "name": "Proposal Generator",
  "description": "Takes a deal ID, fetches deal and associated contact from HubSpot, generates a formatted client proposal via Claude.",
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4a1a939c-1410-40c1-bd1d-bde891364fc0",
      "name": "Sticky Note 22e33117",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        190,
        250
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Proposal Generator — Deal-Based\n\n**How to use from Cowork:**\n1. Open the \"Set Deal ID\" node\n2. Change the `dealId` value to the HubSpot Deal ID you want to generate a proposal for\n3. Click Test Workflow\n4. The `proposal` field in the output contains the full generated text\n\nFind deal IDs in HubSpot: open any deal record and copy the numeric ID from the URL.",
        "color": 3,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8fa5a7c0-f479-438e-baf9-8e6895031b80",
      "name": "Run: Enter Deal ID Below",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
